  "records": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain's Cabin",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yamada Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Well? Is the investigation going smoothly?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I would hardly call it a good start...may I ask you a few questions?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Go ahead.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Time to begin the interrogation.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain of a luxury liner...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He looks intimidating...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Weathered...a self-made, hands-on captain.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Have all your crew served with you for years?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've been at sea since the age of sail.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How refined.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How should I approach this?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Keep it brief.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The ticket lists the operating company...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Trans-Atlantic. The ship was newly built at a Philadelphia yard in 1905.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "She is small for a passenger liner, but exceptionally sturdy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Built in Philadelphia in 1905...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Shimose explosives burned Russian battleships like paper. However sturdy she is, this is still a passenger ship.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't call my ship 'this'!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sorry...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You have questions. Continue.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "1905...the year the Russo-Japanese War ended.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sharp. This hull was meant for a warship to be sold to Russia or Japan. America was neutral. When the war ended, it lost its buyer, and our chairman bought it cheap.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Is that what you wanted to ask?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...no.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It was just a prelude. Sometimes it helps to pursue something seemingly unrelated before getting to the point.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Are you mocking me? I hate people who beat around the bush.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Thought so.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Um...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Spit it out!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Seasick? Think before you speak, Kasuke.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There is so much here that interests me...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A sturdy ship draws insurers. Every offer carried unusually favorable terms.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Lloyd's of London led the pack. You came about Ashby's insurance claim, didn't you?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Just as he guessed.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The operating company could have staged the hijacking itself.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Bold words. I like that.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then tell me the truth.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't act so spineless.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A little time away from the field, and look at me. I'm a salesman. Read the man!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "1.2 million pounds is no small sum. It could build three or four ships of this class. Losing one would barely hurt the company. Insurance fraud is possible.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ha! A salesman is good with figures. But you're still an employee. No corporation would do anything that stupid.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Tell me: what matters most in the shipping business?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Luxurious interiors...and service.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Wrong, you fool!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Guh...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...I don't know.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then say anything!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Think about the captain's nature...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Speed. Every line now competes for the fastest crossing between Europe and America.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Wrong. Safety, and its image. Safety, certainty, lives first. People trust Trans-Atlantic ships never to have accidents.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've known the chairman since our sailing days. He's steady and serious. We sailed together. He knows the terror of the sea, and what trust is worth. He would never trade that for quick money.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Quite the old salt...and not a man who lies.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I will help your investigation. But you will not suspect my crew. They are family. We have crossed deadly seas together. Look elsewhere.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A poor start...damn. This is what happens when I act on a theory I don't believe.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "policy": "preserve",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First-Class Cabin Block",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cabin B is beside Cabin A, where I found the wireless set. I'll start there.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Outside First-Class B",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No answer at Cabin B. I'll try C and D on the port side.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First-Class C Door",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Tianon",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First-Class Cabin C",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Oh? You seem troubled...allow me to divine your fortune.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Whoa...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No, thank you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You mustn't refuse.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What am I supposed to say?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Um, well...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Oh!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ohhh!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ooooh...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Um...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm investigating the bomber...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Oh! A giant firebird...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I see it...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Oh! Oh! Ooooooh!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Aaaah...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I-I'll come back another time...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First-Class D Door",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Lumeranka",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...enter!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First-Class Cabin D",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The person who just entered the next room...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Was it a man?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What the hell? Don't bite my head off out of nowhere...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What did you see?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This one is unhinged too.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What I look at is my own business.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Insolent! You...you...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This is not my day...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Why are you so angry?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Silence! Answer me, you lowborn fool! Mind your tongue! Keep your head down!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You're just short!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I saw a beautiful woman...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ah! So you did see her! Ki-ki-ki...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't lose it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Y-you! Who are you?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Why are you so angry? You're scary...and strange.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Strange face! Strange face! Strange face!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Anyone will do!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Such insolence! Mind your tongue!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Please calm down.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Spoiled brat!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Um...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You...you're a spy sent by the Chancellor!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So that explosion was your doing too! I won't hand the princess over to anyone! Go back and tell the Chancellor: as long as Princess Tianon, the rightful heir to the throne, lives, this country will never be yours! Get out!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Of course!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'll be sure to tell him...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Never return!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This is exhausting...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "If possible, I'd like to.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite Block",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suites A and B are to port. The small starboard rooms are for attendants. I'll start with Suite B.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite B",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I am Georges Braque, an art dealer known throughout Paris.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What a belly. He looks vile.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "For an incident this serious, the culprit must have made a demand. Am I wrong?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Arrogant...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What a nasty man.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He knows something...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Stop acting so superior.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This has something to do with you, doesn't it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What do you mean?! I'm a specially invited passenger, and a victim of this incident! What are you saying to me?! Are you in your right mind?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Maybe I am crazy...that is strange.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then what did the culprit demand?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've heard rumors about you in Paris...none flattering. You bind young artists with money and drive them like slaves.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "They are spoiled and mercenary. Fledglings need not be treated as equals. Enough. Talk about the culprit.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit demands only one thing...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Money?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A work of art? Answer me clearly!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So arrogant...irritating.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't intend to be your pawn. Could you stop giving me orders?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Bah! Insolent boy!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You must be very important.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Of course. Think of me as the man behind this century's greatest trend: Art Nouveau.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A trend, huh...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Answer my question. The culprit only demanded a search for the Russian Fog. As a fellow passenger caught up in this, will you help?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian Fog?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit demands that?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Oh? He knows it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You know it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Who do you think I am, you insolent brat? Mind your tongue!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We're both rude.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes, that.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Which 'that'?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You know what it is?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Only by rumor. The legendary treasure of the St. Petersburg palace!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A jewel dearly treasured by Tsar Nicholas II. That is all I've heard, but even I would love to possess it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The St. Petersburg Palace, of all places...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So what is this legendary treasure?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What would an ape like you know? Russia may be Europe's eastern backwater, but it is a white country. Your little island has another faith, another skin, and can scarcely be called human!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Does he have to say it like that?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How unpleasant.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Revolutionary fervor is boiling there. Soon there will be no business left...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "St. Petersburg...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Capital of the Russian Empire. The tsar is a scoundrel, but its beauty may be unequaled in Europe.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Paris's narrow-minded crowd all sneer, but I appreciate it. Everything from there is beautiful. The Russian Fog is the pinnacle...I see. So it is aboard this ship...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit thinks so...so it was a jewel...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Of course it is. Why else would the culprit go this far? For that treasure, one ship or two is nothing!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    }
  ]
}
